Ship and thruster artwork of the AsteroidOS version (assets/ there).

title-art.jpg: cover art for the title screen (and, dimmed to half, the
game over screen). AI-generated with Grok (xAI) in October 2026 from a
prompt written with the author, in the style of the Asteroid Blaster
cover art; cropped to the landing pad and crater, and its grey ground
tinted towards Blaster's violet with ImageMagick; JPEG quality 85,
864 x 1920.
